{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴基斯坦西北部城市白沙瓦一間學校的屋頂周四（15日）突然坍塌，造成至少18名學生及一名老師死亡。</p><p>事故另造成40人受傷，部分人情況危殆。</p><p>暫未知塌屋頂原因，所有傷亡學生均為13歲以下。</p><p>（路透社/BBC）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:02:28.258344+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T07:30:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:37:39.114382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:38.183175+00:00","content_hash":"f20d0bc6f67a42f148442dd98bf22fbadbc0cf138cab1390f63cda644a95ca8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}